      "confidence": "exact",
      "coverage_note": "fastify.get('/users/:id', getUser): the HTTP method is the call's own name and the URL is call.arg0_text, so the route is keyed by what it serves and agrees with the same URL declared under any other framework. The handler named as the call's last argument is the other end of handles. field_prefix / on call.arg0_text is what separates a route from Map.prototype.get in the same file."
